    "Series rápidas, a ritmo de carrera de 3 a 5 km, con trote suave entre medio. Mejoran tu VO₂ máx. y tu economía de carrera. Todas iguales: la última no debería ser la peor.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fast repeats at 3–5 km race pace with easy jogging in between. They improve your VO₂ max and running economy. Keep them even: the last one shouldn't be the worst."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Snabba intervaller i tävlingsfart för 3–5 km med lugn jogg emellan. De förbättrar din VO₂-max och löpekonomi. Håll dem jämna: den sista ska inte vara sämst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Series terminadas. Vuelta a la calma: camina o trota suave, mido tu recuperación.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intervals done. Cool-down: walk or jog easy, I'm measuring your recovery."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intervallerna klara. Nedvarvning: gå eller jogga lugnt, jag mäter din återhämtning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Series y recuperaciones": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intervals and recoveries"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intervaller och vila"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Series: %@ × %@ a %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reps: %@ × %@ at %@"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
